Vnum            11008
Name            離響偏廊~
Description
偏廊兩側嵌著一排碎裂導響片，碎片仍在陰影裡斷續亮起，像在替每一次魄壓外洩留下難以抹平的空響痕跡。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       WEST
ExitVnum        11007
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       EAST
ExitVnum        11009
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
